### Come and celebrate XMAS 2018 on Bribie Island

Well this would have to be Rhythm Culture's biggest and best XMAS party yet! Come and celebrate XMAS 2018 with international artists from Guinea and Japan, local artists and an African feast and show on the beautiful Bribie Island. This event will be an extension of our [Camp Afro Foli](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) Drum and Dance Summer Retreat, so if you can't make it to the camp then come and join us for some great vibes and huge amounts of fun! You can purchase your dinner and show performances [here](/product/camp-afro-foli-african-feast-show/). When: Saturday December 1st from 6pm - 10pm Where: [Bribie Island Retreat and Recreation Centre](http://www.gobribieisland.org/contact-us/location/) 2- 12 Third Avenue, Woorim QLD 4507 Cost: $20 Child (8+), $35 Adult ![full camp](/media/2016/12/Camp-Afro-Foli-Summer-Retreat.jpg)
